# P-Stack

For non-trivial Terminal49/API work, use the installed P-Stack plugin's
`/poteto-mode` workflow when available. Use `/how` for unfamiliar subsystems,
the repository's `npm run agent-verify` for proof, and `/reflect` to turn
durable lessons into executable guards.

Model and reasoning-budget choices belong in the user-local file created by
`/setup-pstack`; never commit personal model slugs.
